## Interface: 16001
## Title: AzerothQuant
## Notes: Records Auction House data for the azerothquant Brain and shows its Recommendations. Never buys or bids; posts or cancels only when its Post or Cancel undercut button is clicked.
## Version: 0.2.1
## SavedVariables: AzerothQuantDB

# Written by the Brain (never edit). It must exist when the client starts, since new
# files aren't picked up on /reload, so the Addon ships a stub. The Brain writes the same
# file into AzerothQuant_Data1..3, LoadOnDemand addons it creates, which the Addon tries
# by itself after a reload (ADR-0030).
Recommendations.lua

